%% CI/CD pipeline & quality gates (17 workflows)
%% Canonical source. Regenerate exports with: npm run docs:diagrams
flowchart TD
    classDef gate fill:#1168bd,stroke:#0b4884,color:#fff
    classDef deploy fill:#2d6a4f,stroke:#1b4332,color:#fff
    classDef sched fill:#5a189a,stroke:#3c096c,color:#fff
    classDef warn fill:#e85d04,stroke:#9a3b00,color:#fff

    PR([Push / PR to master]) --> G1[lint - eslint]:::gate
    G1 --> G2[type check - tsc --noEmit]:::gate
    G2 --> G3[unit + coverage floor 71/64/72/72]:::gate
    G3 --> G4[e2e - Playwright hermetic]:::gate
    G4 --> G5[apply migrations + drift check]:::gate
    G5 --> DEP[deploy.yml -> Azure SWA]:::deploy
    DEP --> HC[health check /api/health]:::deploy

    subgraph OTHER[Other CI workflows]
        W1[db-tests.yml - real Postgres RLS tests]:::gate
        W2[benchmark.yml - precision/recall, weekly]:::gate
        W3[sast-rules.yml - opengrep validate/test]:::gate
        W4[terraform-security-scan.yml - Checkov]:::gate
        W5[tool-integration.yml - real scanner binaries]:::gate
    end

    subgraph SCHEDULES[Scheduled runners]
        S1[scheduled-scans.yml / on-demand-scan.yml]:::sched
        S2[daily-blog / weekly-newsletter / monthly-digest]:::sched
        S3[emerging-threats 6h / scheduled-reports / publish-scheduled-posts]:::sched
        S4[data-retention-cleanup / deletion-requests]:::sched
    end

    SUPPLY[Supply-chain gap: all 'uses:' pinned to mutable tags, NOT SHAs - FINDING I-4<br/>No self-dependency CVE scan - the product flags this on customers but not itself]:::warn
